+tails, or zero if not.</dd>
+            <dt pn="section-5.13.3-15.9">Final (F)</dt>
+            <dd pn="section-5.13.3-15.10">Set to 1 if the local system is responding to a BFD Control
+packet received with the Poll (P) bit set, or zero if not.</dd>
+            <dt pn="section-5.13.3-15.11">Control Plane Independent (C)</dt>
+            <dd pn="section-5.13.3-15.12">Set to 1 if the local system's BFD implementation is
+independent of the control plane (it can continue to function
+through a disruption of the control plane).</dd>
+            <dt pn="section-5.13.3-15.13">Authentication Present (A)</dt>
+            <dd pn="section-5.13.3-15.14">Set to 1 if authentication is in use in this session
