+            <dd pn="section-5.13.3-15.16">Set to bfd.DemandMode if bfd.SessionState is Up and
+bfd.RemoteSessionState is Up.  Set to 1 if bfd.SessionType is
+MultipointHead.  Otherwise, it is set to zero.</dd>
+            <dt pn="section-5.13.3-15.17">Multipoint (M)</dt>
+            <dd pn="section-5.13.3-15.18">Set to 1 if bfd.SessionType is MultipointHead.  Otherwise, it
